Domain Entity PostSecondaryEvent
    documentation "This entity captures significant post-secondary events during a student's high school tenure (e.g., FAFSA application or college application, acceptance, and enrollment) or during a student's enrollment at a post-secondary institution."
    date EventDate
        documentation "The date the event occurred or was recorded."
        is part of identity
    descriptor PostSecondaryEventCategory
        documentation "The post secondary event that is logged."
        is part of identity
    domain entity PostSecondaryInstitution
        documentation "An organization that provides educational programs for individuals who have completed or otherwise left educational programs in secondary school(s)."
        is optional
    domain entity Student
        documentation "The student associated with the post secondary event."
        is part of identity
